{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"86372cbd4b76439edb9041576abb7dfc01d63bf176d0f30946645635dc750c60","digest":{"component_or_area":"bridge suggest-mapping command","key_entities":["rebar bridge suggest-mapping","mapping_probe.py","mapping_config.py","bridge.py","_bridge_commands.py","_config_writer._emit_nested_toml","_config_writer._emit_config_toml","jira.JIRA.issue_types()","jira.JIRA.priorities()","jira.JIRA.issue_link_types()","jira.JIRA.statuses()","jira.JIRA.createmeta_issuetypes()","jira.JIRA.search_issues()","jira.JIRA.transitions()","[tool.rebar.mapping]","status_map","type_map","link_map","priority_map","create_defaults","hierarchy"],"problem_keywords":["jira probe","mapping configuration","vocabulary discovery","axis mapping","toml serialization","read-only command"],"propositions":["A new read-only command `rebar bridge suggest-mapping <PROJECT>` probes a live Jira instance and emits a suggested `[tool.rebar.mapping]` block populated with discovered vocabulary and identity-seeded axis maps.","The probe discovers issue types, statuses, link types, priorities, and hierarchy levels via public pycontribs JIRA client methods without creating or modifying Jira resources.","The `--write` flag merges the suggested mapping into an existing rebar.toml file while preserving hand-edited flat sections and existing mapping keys, never modifying pyproject.toml.","Transition hints are surfaced as best-effort advisory data based on sample issues and their current-status transitions, not guaranteed to be complete.","TOML serialization uses a two-path orchestrator: flat top-level items via the existing `_emit_toml`, nested `[mapping.*]` sub-tables via new `_emit_nested_toml`."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787729596974996001,"uuid":"340eeb91-e4cc-4cb8-ae9a-a0a9c78eb871"}